        "quote": "(b) Upon issuance, the license shall be displayed and available for inspection on the business premises of the licensee. Alarm installers shall carry their license with them while servicing or installing alarm systems.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.15.060:block:1#text",
